{"id":3491,"date":"2017-03-14T18:59:33","date_gmt":"2017-03-15T01:59:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=3491"},"modified":"2017-03-14T18:59:33","modified_gmt":"2017-03-15T01:59:33","slug":"roswell-here-we-come","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/03\/14\/roswell-here-we-come\/","title":{"rendered":"Roswell Here We Come!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>We drove to Benson, AZ Monday, got in about 4pm or so, had dinner in, went for our 2 mile walk around the park and then sat out after dark and gazed at the stars. \u00a0I took a pix of the Big Dipper, but it was with my &#8220;smart&#8221; phone so I don&#8217;t know if you can see it or not.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-13-19.18.43.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-3492 alignright\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-13-19.18.43-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-13-19.18.43-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-13-19.18.43-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-13-19.18.43-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-13-19.18.43.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>I guess if you look real carefully you can see the four corners, but not the handle.<\/p>\n<p>Another beautiful desert sunrise Tuesday morning and we then drove 6+ hours to make it to Lakewood, NM through an 8000&#8242; pass just east of Alamogordo, NM. \u00a0It was a beautiful drive and the coach behaved well, even towing the car uphill.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-3491 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-large'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.43.43.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.43.43-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3493\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.43.43-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.43.43-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.43.43-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.43.43.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3493'>\n\t\t\t\tOur coach in the morning at Benson\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.43.33.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.43.33-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3494\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.43.33-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.43.33-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.43.33-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.43.33.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3494'>\n\t\t\t\tWe were &#8220;Dry Camping&#8221; (no utilities)\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.42.51.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.42.51-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3495\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.42.51-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.42.51-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.42.51-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-14-06.42.51.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3495'>\n\t\t\t\tLooking down the row\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>It&#8217;s Tuesday night, Kathy&#8217;s warming up leftover enchiladas (yum) and we&#8217;re looking forward to the sunrise across the desert in the morning.<\/p>\n<p>I&#8217;ll post more tomorrow after our day trip to Roswell.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We drove to Benson, AZ Monday, got in about 4pm or so, had dinner in, went for our 2 mile walk around the park and then sat out after dark and gazed at the stars. \u00a0I took a pix of the Big Dipper, but it was with my &#8220;smart&#8221; phone so I don&#8217;t know if &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/03\/14\/roswell-here-we-come\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Roswell Here We Come!<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[19546],"tags":[554707321,5547